`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["SuperSplat's ordinary export gathers visible, nonempty scene layers; its default does ",e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"not"})," mean “export selected Gaussians only.” Selection filtering is an optional serializer setting, also used for copy/paste. Deletion removes instances from the live list, with undo records; selected-and-locked instances are excluded from selection-driven deletion. Crop-by-select/invert/delete is therefore different from merely drawing a selection or hiding a whole layer."]}),`
