`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["The ",e.jsx(t.code,{children:".ssproj"})," path writes document JSON, camera/view/timeline/pose settings, original resource rows and per-layer instance/palette data. Ordinary splat export instead bakes edits and does not serialize those editor-state records. Importantly, project saving is not an unconditional deleted-data archive: normal compact saves drop rows unreferenced by any layer; an in-place save keeps rows so current-session undo can still access them. Do not infer that undo history survives reopening."]}),`
