`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["In this SuperSplat UI path, compressed PLY, SOG and SPZ set minimum opacity to 1/255 and enable the implementation's invalid-data filter; ordinary PLY does not enable those settings. The predicate drops source sigmoid opacity ",e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"strictly below"})," the threshold, before the later grading step. “Invalid” follows the actual attribute-specific predicates, not a blanket rule forbidding every infinite raw log-domain value."]}),`
