`,e.jsxs(t.p,{children:["Unity routes only ",e.jsx(t.code,{children:".ply"})," and ",e.jsx(t.code,{children:".spz"}),"; its PLY reader requires binary little-endian 1.0, and the Gaussian reader requires float-valued position, DC color, opacity, scale and quaternion attributes. General mesh PLY, ASCII PLY, SOG and a filename ending in ",e.jsx(t.code,{children:".ply"})," are not substitutes for that schema. Required-field validation does not check complete higher-order SH preservation."]}),`
