`,e.jsx(t.p,{children:"The pinned Unity editing guide advises Very High import quality for editing because lower presets are already quantized/approximated. Export excludes deleted and cutout Gaussians; the documented world-space option bakes transforms and rotates SH. Cutouts are visual inclusion/exclusion volumes, not collision bodies. Manual editing has no Undo; the guide suggests disabling/re-enabling the renderer to revert all edits."}),`
