`,e.jsxs(t.li,{children:[e.jsx(t.strong,{children:"Reuse and invalidation:"})," bake once, assign to matching colliders, then separately change flags, geometry and transform hierarchy. Include mirrored convex/nonconvex variants and scaled-parent/rotated-child shear. Record assignment diagnostics and profiler evidence; do not infer reuse from an unchanged screenshot. Verify scheduling rejects duplicate concurrent mesh IDs without actually racing native cooks."]}),`
